I created a Q&A site at Shapado [1] and populated it with a few
questions and even fewer answers.

It's obviously not a game but it does have some of the stuff we wanted
from a game. It has rewards, badges and points. It should help new
lojbanists learn. They even get points for asking questions! I'll
suggest joining the site on the beginner's list.

I also created a thread about days of the week there [2]. I think
it'll be helpful since we can vote on the best suggestions and have a
more structured discussion. Alternatively, we could just post the
result of the discussion.

Please join the effort!

mu'o mi'e tcatipax

